+// of the requested cluster (or of all trusted clusters when clusterName is
+// empty). If the pool would exceed the limit - which can happen on clusters
+// with a very large number of trusted clusters - it falls back to a minimal
+// pool containing only the current cluster's host certificate authority so
+// that the handshake can still complete instead of panicking.
